    "title": "Maggie Baugh Returns to Social Media Amid Keith Urban Speculation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Just Jared ,\n14 hours ago Maggie Baugh has returned to social media.\nThe country music singer dropped onto Instagram for the second time this week, amid speculation and rumors she may be involved with Keith Urban , whose divorce was just revealed last week.\nKeep reading to find out more…\nEarlier in the week, Maggie shared a blank, black photo teasing an announcement was coming soon.\nOn Wednesday (October 8), the singer and musician announced a new single coming this week.\n“The Devil Win • 10.10 Pre-Save Link in my Bio❤️‍🔥 #thedevilwin,” she wrote in the caption.\nHow is Maggie involved in the Keith Urban divorce news?\nWell, she has been touring with the superstar as a “utlitiy player” in his band, and days before his divorce news, he changed lyrics to a song that many have thought to be about soon-to-be ex-wife Nicole Kidman , and included Maggie ‘s name.\nIn the song, he originally sings “baby,” but changed that to Maggie . The next day, it was resurfaced that he changed a similar lyric back in April.\n17",
